OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fcloudy in the west but some clear
OL,7,Fbreaks in the east. Cloud can be thick
OL,8,Fenough to bring some light rain and
OL,9,Fdrizzle, mostly on higher ground. A
OL,10,Fchilly night with grass frost possible.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloud remains in the north
OL,13,Fbut lifts and breaks through the day.
OL,14,FBrighter in the south with more sunny
OL,15,Fspells. Another warm with temperatures
OL,16,Fabove average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
